  {
   "id": "the-bunker-24017@post-2019-02-05",
   "gameId": "the-bunker-24017",
   "displayName": "The FMV Horror is On Sale!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2019-02-05T09:45:50.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The interactive horror movie, The Bunker, is now 40% in the Wales Interactive sale!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Bunker is a completely live-action experience, filmed on location in a decommissioned government nuclear bunker with a plot crafted by the writer and designers behind The Witcher, Broken Sword and SOMA. Starring an incredible cast including Adam Brown (The Hobbit), Sarah Greene (Penny Dreadful) and Grahame Fox (Game of Thrones).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "GamesRadar “The other hero here is the sound design and music…Playing in the dark with my headphones in, this scene got under my skin in in a way few games have.”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "True Achievements \"The Bunker is a special game in that it tries to be different from everything else and developers have done a great job in creating a tense adventure.\" 4/5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "God Is Geek \"The Bunker is something genuinely new, compelling and wonderfully original.\" 7/10",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Destructoid “The Bunker perfectly captures John’s sense of claustrophobia and paranoia with intense close-ups, security footage, and just a really good use of lighting.” 7/10",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Not only that, you can also save on our other award-winning FMV games, Late Shift, The Shapeshifting Detective and the FMV Bundle!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Follow Our Steam Creator Page",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You can follow our news on Facebook, Twitter or our brand new Steam Creator Homepage which you can follow for updates on new game releases!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don't forget to head over to the forums to reminisce about your favourite FMV games of all time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Wales Interactive",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
